    "Figure_2_ovr_roc": {
      "caption": "Figure 2. One-versus-rest receiver operating characteristic (ROC) curves for the primary YOLO11l-cls model (seed 0) in (A) internal validation and (B) external test. Legends give class-specific areas under the curve (AUC); macro AUC is their unweighted mean. The 95% confidence intervals are the previously computed image-level percentile bootstrap intervals (2000 replicates) for the fixed fitted model. Insets display the same curves over false-positive rates 0.00-0.20 and true-positive rates 0.80-1.00; dashed rectangles mark the corresponding regions in the full-scale plots. The dashed diagonals are no-discrimination references. Curves were reconstructed directly from saved probabilities without smoothing.",
